{"parse":{"title":"人物情报：麦莎","pageid":152,"revid":349,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%9A%E9%BA%A6%E8%8E%8E&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%9A%E9%BA%A6%E8%8E%8E&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%9A%E9%BA%A6%E8%8E%8E&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE\" title=\"科普\">科普</a> &gt; <b>人物情报：麦莎</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E3.80.90.E4.BC.8A.E5.88.A9.E4.BA.9A.E7.99.BE.E7.A7.91.E3.80.91.E4.BA.BA.E7.89.A9.E6.83.85.E6.8A.A5_.7C_.E9.BA.A6.E8.8E.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"【伊利亚百科】人物情报_|_麦莎\">【伊利亚百科】人物情报 | 麦莎</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%9A%E9%BA%A6%E8%8E%8E&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：【伊利亚百科】人物情报 | 麦莎\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：铃兰之剑摄制组<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2021-08-18 16:20<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FQrq4hPvrQq0P0RAKLcBThw\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Qrq4hPvrQq0P0RAKLcBThw</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(230,230,230)\">\n<p><br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><big><big><big><font color=\"#808000\"><b>麦莎</b></font></big></big></big>\n<p><br /><br />\n</p>\n<table style=\"width:85%; background-color:#808000; color:#ffffff\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">「铃兰之剑」佣兵团成员\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br /><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:92%; background-color:#ffffff; border-color:#808000\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:0px\"><br /><center><img alt=\"官方消息6.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/etuubzgkddk7ol21gvxt5kvva9msqmp.png/400px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"711\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/etuubzgkddk7ol21gvxt5kvva9msqmp.png/600px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/etuubzgkddk7ol21gvxt5kvva9msqmp.png/800px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /></center>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:0px\"><center>\n<table style=\"width:90%; color:#808000\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><br /><br />\n<p>善良活泼，大大咧咧的佣兵少女。\n<br /><br />\n外地逃难来的孤儿，在镇民和拉维耶的帮助下才健康长大。\n<br /><br />\n为人乐观坚强，永不放弃。\n<br /><br />\n富有正义感和同情心，愿望是保护家人、保护小镇、保护所有人。\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息7.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f6/il8t2qbfjhyl7v9qlrmbem0r6s9jyet.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"146\" height=\"65\" data-file-width=\"146\" data-file-height=\"65\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:92%; background-color:#ffffff; border-color:#808000\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:0px\"><center>\n<table style=\"width:90%; color:#808000\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><br />“嘿嘿，没事的，这都是我应该做的，交给我就好啦。”\n<p><br />“保护大家，就是我的职责，嘿嘿~”\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息5.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/18/84pqv42enl9qvjdwfz6kk3tll8sjs26.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"57\" data-file-width=\"180\" data-file-height=\"57\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<table style=\"width:92%; background-color:#808000\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:0px\"><center>\n<table style=\"width:90%; color:#ffffff\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><br />《伊利亚百科》是《铃兰之剑：为这和平的世界》游戏的世界观内容，主要对伊利亚王国几千年的历史和动荡的现状进行一个白描，包含伊利亚王国以及周边国家的历史与地理、传统与宗教、政治与王室和重要的人物介绍。玩家在游戏中体验到的多周目剧情和沙盒玩法，都是在这片广袤的大地上展开。\n<p><br />*本游戏故事纯属虚构，与现实中一切个人与团体均无关联，如有雷同，纯属巧合。\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</center>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163458\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 89/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1852/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.347      1 -total\n 59.33%   18.004      1 模板:面包屑\n 40.33%   12.238      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:152-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163458 and revision id 349. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"科普","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息6.png",